    : For 'C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft SQL Server\\160\\Setup Bootstrap\\Log\\20240202_110130\\sql_dmf_loc_Cpu64_1033_1.log': 'soteria' failed test of 'case insensitive equals' compared to ''\n                        : For 'C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft SQL Server\\160\\Setup Bootstrap\\Log\\20240202_110130\\sql_engine_core_inst_Cpu64_1.log': 'soteria' failed test of 'case insensitive equals' compared to ''\n                        : For 'C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft SQL Server\\160\\Setup Bootstrap\\Log\\20240202_110130\\sql_engine_core_inst_loc_Cpu64_1033_1.log': 'soteria' failed test of 'case insensitive equals' compared to ''\n                        : For 'C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft SQL Server\\160\\Setup Bootstrap\\Log\\20240202_110130\\sql_engine_core_shared_Cpu64_1.log': 'soteria' failed test of 'case insensitive equals' compared to ''\n                        : For 'C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft SQL Server\\160\\Setup Bootstrap\\Log\\20240202_110130\\sql_engine_core_shared_loc_Cpu64_1033_1.log': 'soteria' failed test of 'case insensitive equals' compared to ''\n                        : For 'C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft SQL Server\\160\\Setup Bootstrap\\Log\\20240202_110130\\sql_fulltext_Cpu64_1.log': 'soteria' failed test of 'case insensitive equals' compared to ''\n                        : For 'C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft SQL Server\\160\\Setup Bootstrap\\Log\\20240202_110130\\sql_xevent_Cpu64_1.log': 'soteria' failed test of 'case insensitive equals' compared to ''\n                        : For 'C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft SQL Server\\160\\Setup Bootstrap\\Log\\20240202_110130\\sql_xevent_loc_Cpu64_1033_1.log': 'soteria' failed test of 'case insensitive equals' compared to ''\n                        : For 'C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft SQL Server\\160\\Setup Bootstrap\\Log\\20240203_090155\\SQLEXPRESS\\AdvancedAnalytics_Cpu64_1.log': 'SYSTEM' failed test of 'case insensitive equals' compared to ''\n                        : For 'C:\\Program Files\\M